Z||000000||b lo 0||07-21-2000||02:05 PM||||I just got my '85 GT and therefore have no room for my '86 Nissan Pulsar.  It's in great condition with auto air and sunroof, if anyone wants it, let me know.  It makes a great first car (it was my first car, and I'm sad to see it go) so buy it for your kids!  Runs like new and will last forever-$1750.  Atlanta, GA area.  I was sad to have to sell it for a few minutes, that is until I remembered that I was selling it to get a FIERO!!!  Not only that, but a GT to boot!!  My big sis had a raggedy '85 GT a few years ago, and even though it was really shabby-she got it for $500-I absolutely LOVED that car, and now I have an '85 GT of my own!!!  Cheers to all the other dedicated Fiero owners!!  I can't remember if I bought a Fiero because of the great performance ar the comraderie that comes with owning one.  I'm only 18, and my dad is a trained mechanic at 50 years young, and thanks to people like yall, I already know more about Fieros than he does!!  Well, I'll shut up for now.  If anyone wants progress pics of my project, including wheels, suspension, interior, body and stereo mods, drop me a line and ask!!  Also, try my company's website at <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery" TARGET=_blank>www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery</A>  for great stereo stuff, including everything I'm using for my stereo, including a head unit which fits the dash opening perfectly (1.5 DIN size) 4x10" dash speakers, and the carbon fiber cone speakers (3.5") going in the headrests.  The only thing I'm not getting from myself is the sub and amp-I already had those lying around.  I'll be sure to keep yall posted, and btw-here's a pic my design firm Catalyst Concepts drew up in Photoshop-including my wheels of choice, dropped suspension and 16" DTM style wing.  Only diff is mine's gonna be white with blue stripes and has GT ground effects in gray.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/fierocustom1.gif">   Hope ya like it!!<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>GAWD I love this car||||reg||10
