Z||000008||batboy||07-23-2000||09:24 PM||||Welcome to the wonderful world of Fieros.<P>Isn't that pic you posted from the Tire Rack?<P>What is a Zex nitro kit???<P>Also, the Fiero air cleaner and intake setup is very efficient. Lots of old topics about trying to impove air flow, but really not much power increases. That Tornado product is mostly a gimmick and was discussed at one time on the Forum too. A 20-25 horsepower gain, even on an Acura, is WAY too good to be true. Show me the dyno numbers, before and after, with that Tornado thingie being the only change.<P>Wkayl...yer momma wears combat boots! Just joking of course...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
